", "id": "727798082914645", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_727798086247978_7927465019836939760_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bqUZ3ZD5KwIQ7kNvwFAJVvF&_nc_oc=AdoKyxI9-xGQ23zrBFYF97u-jlm7oOjzbseWbZS2eAnh_ihw3fdaH1gEyC0uWCSchQ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOFjTF_oPbN19kEv-vaGR499chzFusp0jfpITDYvN6RTA&oe=6AC3CE3C"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_Skinwalker.png", "id": "610206122074633", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393909_610206125407966_8943337466549821229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZmhzbX3lGi4Q7kNvwEawSCZ&_nc_oc=Adqmmqer7-YYgn5rNRuJsE2penlDOpwPiWAiSborCyRJMF2qxaJpsb4wjq19i2I1XoI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN-r4lJzGSarHmymjLhdK6TG8osnYHbLVUwB95sE4M9pQ&oe=6AC3A690"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_DoubleDoor.png", "id": "739262415278358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_739262421945024_4016414250370504064_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V8EbJo-yXKsQ7kNvwFQEBWn&_nc_oc=AdomQJrhWbONPVa9SvAWxhS3hGud05Chs4omg9mBllreL-7ik3L1q-VeloY2IetjvS0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM3F_p-CrWptTWzMo99O--GuUwr6G4pu5R7j8XsOz71_g&oe=6AC3BAC4"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_ParcelStacking.png", "id": "553200994506830", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_553200997840163_8421225844214804779_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kExv0K2DRUgQ7kNvwHq2NA-&_nc_oc=AdonW33YwEAfl_M-ftyUEayGG-mzA0cPio4HiM5ZnRSF39kvfHvyimGg4kjdFpxAr8s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPeWD3O68dnYAIxYq5cJHFofug3YQp7Jp-b04HLm_s2zg&oe=6AC3A51B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_2560x1440_DD_01.png", "id": "560042380474257", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391883_560042383807590_668531239392494770_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wD23r3jPS8EQ7kNvwFV0L68&_nc_oc=Adrg2DESftiLkEtUIiRBusTVu3l67eE-AGwTJq18HGz5sAJITyY7D6I0TMna19HmxRw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPJ8bnFtvJ2vG4jyGS0kF_zk18SHAmGoELlFh1sQhzV8w&oe=6AC3CB30"}, "display_name": "Deadly Delivery", "keywords": ["Delivery", "Lethal", "Deadly", "Multiplayer", "Horror"], "long_description": "# Your shift starts now. Good luck.\n\nIn Deadly Delivery, you and your fellow delivery goblins are tasked with delivering parcels into pitch-black mines full of... things. Armed with questionable equipment, you'll sneak, sprint, and scream your way through procedurally generated tunnels.\n\n\n\n# Features\n# \ud83d\udc80 Deadly Co-op Missions\n Team up with up to 3 other players in online co-op. Coordinate, deliver, and survive\u2014or watch your coworkers get picked off one by one.\n\n\n# \ud83d\udd26 Physics based VR Horror\n Built for VR with a physics based world, spatial audio, and proximity voice chat. \nHaul a variety of parcels, climb on other players or give them a slap of encouragement \n\n\n# \ud83d\udc79 Monsters With Personality\n Face off against terrifying entities, some may even look and act like your teammates. Learn their patterns \u2014 or feed them your friends.", "short_description": "An online VR co-op horror game about delivering parcels into haunted mines. \nAvoid monsters, drop off packages, and pray you reach the quota! \nTeam up with up to 3 other delivery goblins, survive your shift and pay back your student loans."}]}, "developer_name": "Flat Head Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://deadlydelivery.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Flat Head Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://deadlydelivery.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "274332603592553